  <section class="summary" aria-labelledby="sum">
    <h2 id="sum">The 30 second version</h2>
    <div><span class="k">Problem</span><p>Your balance says what you have today, never whether it will last until payday.</p></div>
    <div><span class="k">Decision</span><p>Once the app knows the start and end of your month, every number on the screen can be about the month.</p></div>
    <div><span class="k">The one metric that matters</span><p>Balance checks in the last week of the cycle fall, where today they rise</p></div>
    <div><span class="k">What I learned</span><p>Checking the arithmetic across all three caught more problems than any visual review did.</p></div>
  </section>

